Project 1: Model Evaluation

Overview

This project focuses on evaluating the performance of a machine learning model using standard classification metrics and visualization techniques.

Objectives

- Evaluate the trained model on the testing dataset.
- Calculate Accuracy, Precision, Recall, and F1-Score.
- Generate a Classification Report.
- Visualize the Confusion Matrix.

Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn

Learning Outcomes

- Understood machine learning model evaluation techniques.
- Learned to interpret classification metrics.
- Improved data visualization skills.
- Gained hands-on experience with Scikit-learn.

